# Project conventions

This repo is an **rvdata2 extractor/compressor** (C++17, POSIX, CMake, GNU build essentials, cross-platform).

**Source of truth:** read and follow [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) for all coding, layout, brace style, globals/resource ownership, and build-file rules.

Do not invent parallel conventions. Prefer staying within extract/compress tooling scope unless the user asks otherwise.
